* Op-amp models for the Console netlists. Pins: non-inverting input, inverting input, output.
* The netlists instantiate `opamp`; include this file first (see ../NOTES.md, "Netlists").

* Ideal: a nullor. ngspice stands in a 1e9 VCVS; tools/netlist stamps the nullor exactly.
.subckt opamp inp inn out
*@ nullor e1
E1 out 0 inp inn 1e9
.ends opamp

* Rail clip for transient checks: a 5534-class amp on +-18 V rails.
* vsat: peak output swing (datasheet: 32 V p-p typical at +-18 V, 600 ohm load).
* aol: DC open-loop gain (100 V/mV typical). The knee follows LineAmp's soft clip u / sqrt(1 + u^2).
.subckt opamp_rail inp inn out params: vsat=16 aol=1e5
B1 out 0 V = vsat * (aol * (V(inp) - V(inn)) / vsat)
+ / sqrt(1 + ((aol * (V(inp) - V(inn)) / vsat) ** 2))
.ends opamp_rail
